-- src:law08-2022-qh15-577-578:483 | quy định của pháp luật về ngân hàng.
-- On 1 June 2025 only Dieu 100 is wholly in force of the five cited provisions; Dieu 109 and 110 are not in force even in part.
#ASSERT `EVAL UNDER RULES EFFECTIVE AT` (YMD 2025 6 1) (`Dieu 153(1)(c): the cited provision is wholly in force on the day` `Dieu 100` (YMD 2025 6 1))
#ASSERT NOT `EVAL UNDER RULES EFFECTIVE AT` (YMD 2025 6 1) (`Dieu 153(1)(c): the cited provision is at least partly in force on the day` `Dieu 109` (YMD 2025 6 1))
#ASSERT NOT `EVAL UNDER RULES EFFECTIVE AT` (YMD 2025 6 1) (`Dieu 153(1)(c): the cited provision is at least partly in force on the day` `Dieu 110` (YMD 2025 6 1))
#ASSERT NOT `EVAL UNDER RULES EFFECTIVE AT` (YMD 2026 3 1) (`Dieu 153(1)(c): the cited provision is wholly in force on the day` `Dieu 109` (YMD 2030 12 31))

