    `the act causing the damage occurred within the insurance term` IS TRUE
    `the third person's claim was made within the insurance term` IS FALSE
    `the third person claims directly from the insurer` IS FALSE
    `the law provides that the third person may claim directly` IS FALSE
    `amount the insured person must pay the third person by law` IS 0
    `costs of resolving the dispute on liability to the third person` IS 0
