-- src:1958 | nhân thọ nước ngoài nhận chuyển giao phải thỏa thuận với bên mua bảo hiểm,
-- src:1959 | người được bảo hiểm về việc giảm số tiền bảo hiểm hoặc quyền lợi bảo hiểm và
-- src:1960 | các nghĩa vụ khác theo hợp đồng bảo hiểm.
@ref Dieu 27, 92 (src:670-678; src:1953-1960)
`a termination on a portfolio transfer with assets at 80 percent of the reserve` MEANS `A unilateral termination` WITH
    `ground` IS `the policyholder did not agree to the transfer of the portfolio under Dieu 92(4)`
    `terminating party` IS `the policyholder`
    `date of termination` IS YMD 2000 1 1
    `insured event occurred before termination` IS FALSE
    `premium paid for the whole period up to termination` IS 0
    `premium paid for the period after termination` IS 0
    `premium due up to termination` IS 0
    `surrender value` IS 3_000_000
    `the parties agreed otherwise on the surrender value` IS FALSE
    `the contract has a surrender value` IS TRUE
    `value of the transferred assets` IS 80
    `technical reserve of the transferred portfolio` IS 100
`a required transfer with assets at 80 percent of the reserve` MEANS `A portfolio transfer` WITH
    `the Ministry of Finance required it under Dieu 113(8)(c) or (d)` IS TRUE
    `it narrows the content or scope of activity` IS FALSE
    `it follows a division, split, merger, consolidation, dissolution or cessation` IS FALSE
    `it follows a revocation under Dieu 75(1)(a), (d) or (e)` IS FALSE
    `the receiving insurer is already carrying on the line transferred` IS FALSE
    `the receiving insurer meets the capital adequacy ratio and solvency requirements` IS FALSE
    `the receiving insurer meets the conditions to run the line after receipt` IS FALSE
    `value of the assets transferred` IS 80
    `technical reserve of the whole portfolio transferred` IS 100
    `the Ministry of Finance approved in writing` IS FALSE
    `date the Ministry of Finance approved` IS YMD 2000 1 1
    `date the transferor published and notified the policyholders` IS YMD 2000 1 1
#ASSERT `Dieu 27(4): the amount the policyholder receives back` `a termination on a portfolio transfer with assets at 80 percent of the reserve` EQUALS 2_400_000
#ASSERT `Dieu 92(3): the receiving insurer must agree a reduction of sums insured or benefits with the policyholders` `a required transfer with assets at 80 percent of the reserve`

