`a suicide a year after a restoration of a ten-year-old contract` MEANS `A death or injury of the insured person` WITH
    `a third person caused it directly or indirectly` IS FALSE
    `the insured person died by suicide` IS TRUE
    `date of the first premium payment or of the restoration of the contract` IS YMD 2025 3 1
    `date of death` IS YMD 2026 3 1
    `died through the deliberate fault of the policyholder` IS FALSE
    `died through the deliberate fault of a beneficiary` IS FALSE
    `suffered permanent disability through the insured person's own deliberate fault` IS FALSE
    `suffered permanent disability through the deliberate fault of the policyholder` IS FALSE
    `suffered permanent disability through the deliberate fault of a beneficiary` IS FALSE
    `died by execution of a death sentence` IS FALSE
    `the contract excludes the case` IS FALSE
    `the beneficiary who caused it is one among several` IS FALSE
    `the policyholder is dead` IS FALSE
    `surrender value or premium paid, less reasonable costs` IS 0
